<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns both secondary repos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns both secondary repos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned both repurchase agreements it had offered in order to drain 338 million pesos from the secondary market on Monday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The repurchase agreements were placed as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM     AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    200 million     3 days  18.94 pct</p>
<p>    138 million     1 day   18.30 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
